Upstream: projecthamster/hamster commit f14e4276d11c5d69fb6da844735cffc7a718f1f1
Subject: Drop check for ancient dbus versions

The assertion compares dbus.__version__ with distutils.version.LooseVersion.
distutils was removed from Python 3.12; only setuptools' compatibility shim
still provides it. The check is about dbus-python 1.2.14 (2019), which the
GNOME platform is far newer than, so drop it as upstream did.

